.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbweaver-capabilities 1  "capabilities " 
.SH NAME
capabilities \- 🧩 List what each repository in a snapshot can actually do
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcapabilities\fR [\fB\-\-snapshot\fR] [\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
🧩 List what each repository in a snapshot can actually do
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-snapshot\fR \fI<SNAPSHOT>\fR
Snapshot id; defaults to the latest
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<REPO>\fR
Only show capabilities for this repository id
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
